5+49.5 = 5650.5 (including first total). Expected probably total after total = 2800.5 and gift line, then total2 = 2849.? Actually let's see expected: salary total = 2800.5; gift total = 49.5? Then grand_total = 2800.5+49.5 = 2850. Hmm.\n\nLet's examine the actual file.\n\nAlso check temperatures, percentages, rename.\n\nLet me first note this avg oddity and keep going.\n\nLet me look at the Expenses file more; maybe results are fine. Let me go back and open Monthly budget."}
