{"type": "thinking", "text": "Date gaps: \n1) 1981-02-14 18:32:00 to 2026-05-03 14:49:09. Let's compute: From 1981-02-14 to 2026-02-14 = 45 years. Then to 2026-05-03 = 2 months 19 days? Feb 14 + 2 months = Apr 14, + 19 days = May 3. So 45y 2mo 19d. Time: 18:32:00 to 14:49:09 next day? Wait date difference: from Apr 14 18:32 to May 3 14:49:09 = 18 days 20h 17m 9s. Hmm, Feb 14 + 2 months = Apr 14. Apr 14 18:32 → May 3 14:49:09: Apr 14→May 3 is 19 days (Apr has 30 days: 16 remaining in April + 3 = 19 days). 18:32 to 14:49:09 is 20h17m9s less than a day, so 18 days + 20h17m9s. So total 45y 2mo 18d 20h 17m 9s. The app shows that ✓.\n\n2) 2020-03-10 22:15 to 2024-08-25 09:40:30: 4 years (to 2024-03-10), then to 2024-08-25 = 5 months 15 days (Mar 10 + 5mo = Aug 10, +15 d = Aug 25). Time 22:15 → 09:40:30 = 11h25m30s. So 4y 5mo 15d 11h25m30s but app shows 14 d. Hmm. Wait, subtracting a day: duration from Mar 10 22:15 to Aug 25 09:40:30: Aug 25 09:40 minus Mar 10 22:15: days = Aug 25 - Mar 10 = 168 days (Mar 10 to Aug 25). Time difference part: 09:40:30 - 22:15:00 = negative, so borrow: 168-1 = 167 days, + 11:25:30. 167 days in months: 5 months (Mar10→Apr10 31, Apr10→May10 30, May10→Jun10 31, Jun10→Jul10 30, Jul10→Aug10 31 = 153 days), remainder 14 days. So 5 months 14 days 11h25m30s. The app's 14 d is correct! Good.\n\n3) date(2024,1,1) to date(2024,1,8) = 1 week (7 days) ✓.\n\nTime differences next."}
