he input connection is created? That's a real Android quirk! The dev might not have it on their device. If so, the bug would be real on this device but dev can't reproduce.\n\nAlternatively... maybe the selection IS set but only when the name is not \"Untitled\"? Let me test with a different file (e.g., \"Remainders\") and cancel without changing. Open Remainders → tap title → screenshot immediately. If it shows highlight, then the bug is specific to \"Untitled\". If still no highlight, report more evidence.\n\nLet me cancel first."}
